{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的大块直接交代人物状态、原因和心理变化，单看大字就能理解；X的高亮词组较零散，常需依赖小字补足关系。small：Y的感受块大多是可跳读的具体补充，能挂回对应话块；X的小字还承担了不少叙述骨架。core：两版都完整呈现了从渴望亲近、害怕失去到接受不确定性的过程，核心没有明显偏差。concise：Y删去了X几处反复确认的意思，尤其S11自我接纳和S13对失去的担忧，表达更收敛。human：判平，X有“像一句想了很久的话，到了嘴边先沉默几秒”这样的主谓搭配问题，Y也有“一满怀暖阳”“空荡荡的心跳”等不够自然的搭配，整体没有足够稳定的差距。fine：Y更多呈现耳根发烫、声音退远后只剩心跳、喉咙干得发疼等具体的身体体验；X部分感受偏向声部、音高和音乐走势的描写。load：Y每屏大致有2—5个长度适中的大块，切分清楚且与停留时间相称；X高亮片段较多且散布在小字句中，观众需要自行拼接，扫读效率稍低。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1fdda9e7-38ee-44db-b720-d7220d3a836d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T211139384675Z", "elapsed_seconds": 217.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T21:15:17.351031+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2966fd535988e8d0eec15d838f2ea5321307f8817c637b0547a22c2a68ea4dbe", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a